qIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","review_id":"hm6M3EvxZoUmbmCr8Rd4EQ","date":"2021-06-25T17:38:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9519490003585815,"text_excerpt":"We swung in for brunch on a Sunday, and I cannot recommend this place highly enough. To begin with, the entire staff was so pleasant and attentive, and Vyoone herself hooked us up with some bar seating on a vary crowded day. Win! Second, the ambience in the place is just fun - beautiful courtyard if you like sitting outside, and I personally love me some Christmas lights any time of year. It's NOLA! We like this things. The food was so good. We ordered a special catfish benedict that was one of the best things I've eaten in a year. Seriously. Super rich, but just flawlessly cooked. We also split an order of escargot - really tasty if you dig them! Not like the traditional ones we were use..."},{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","review_id":"urlESgI2YiGuwnu8acWmbg","date":"2018-07-15T03:32:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368190169334412,"text_excerpt":"Vyoone's has been open about since earlier this year but you wouldn't know it. The quality of the food and service was great. Our waitress, \"Smilie\" was delightful and a great ambassador for Vyoone's. The space has a comfortable open yet cozy feel to it. Though there is optional outdoor dining, it's mid July in New Orleans and too doggone hot! But the food while nicely seasoned was far from intolerably peppered, and not overly salted. We thoroughly enjoyed the \"Crawfish Beignets\" as a table appetizer. The Redfish served with Lump Crab and a light cream sauce was perfect. Seafood pasta was loaded with Mussels, crab, crawfish and Redfish was a lovely & complimentary cacophony of flavors. An..."},{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","review_id":"7gSEMNuWV7q0dzE1wsB6kQ","date":"2021-04-10T17:41:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9344131946563721,"text_excerpt":"Me and my fiancé came here last night to Celebrate my birthday. We were greeted by the owner, who was also being the hostess of the night. She was very nice and welcoming! The restaurant was busy and you can tell their small team was in the weeds but we still enjoyed our service. We order mojitos which were delicious and strong! We also ordered the BBQ shrimp, filet and crab dinner, and the crab cake with penne pasta. I really enjoyed the food but the portions are tiny for the price. The menu says king crab but it was snow crab, and the crab meat was kind of dry like it was cooked too much. I loved the bbq shrimp! I had to order extra bread because the sauce was soo good! Our dinner was $..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","photo_id":"KIbkweyNw3RVra7WL2PO5Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/KIbkweyNw3RVra7WL2PO5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8548800945281982},{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","photo_id":"hmEBNYMHg6VzWOkkxX241w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/hmEBNYMHg6VzWOkkxX241w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8247554898262024},{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","photo_id":"jBw4-7pUgvWNi6RYMfZ3GA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jBw4-7pUgvWNi6RYMfZ3GA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8124247193336487},{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","photo_id":"dYb9ldnSWa1S1T6eWMHxWQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dYb9ldnSWa1S1T6eWMHxWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7579434514045715},{"business_id":"0yRYIODkl8da3ZDdOmMAZA","photo_id":"_3OYC8hPSl3TOiMGzrtsdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_3OYC8hPSl3TOiMGzrtsdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7169089913368225}]},"notebook_case":null}
